{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to your first shift at The Ice Bin, a local ice cream parlor, owned by the mysterious Mr. Coil. You have 11 days to generate enough revenue to secure your employment and satisfy your boss. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613450/extras/gifone.gif?t=1742938313\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Complete Orders</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete customer orders in timely manner. If you can complete an order in the allocated time, you will be given a tip. Tips are vital for successfully completing a run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613450/extras/third.gif?t=1742938313\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Get Upgrades</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After each day, you are given a choice between 3 randomized items that can be used to increase business revenue. Choose your items wisely. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613450/extras/second.gif?t=1742938313\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Replay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Refine your skills and test your luck by playing multiple runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After receiving your daily item, the game will auto-save.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3613450?t=1742938313","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3613450?t=1742938313","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613450/9216d96bae235abec1824d849fdb9d47d89c74eb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742938313","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613450/9216d96bae235abec1824d849fdb9d47d89c74eb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742938313","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to your first shift at The Ice Bin, a local ice cream parlor, owned by the mysterious Mr. Coil. You have 11 days to generate enough revenue to secure your employment and satisfy your boss. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613450/extras/gifone.gif?t=1742938313\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Complete Orders</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete customer orders in timely manner. If you can complete an order in the allocated time, you will be given a tip. Tips are vital for successfully completing a run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613450/extras/third.gif?t=1742938313\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Get Upgrades</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After each day, you are given a choice between 3 randomized items that can be used to increase business revenue. Choose your items wisely. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613450/extras/second.gif?t=1742938313\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Replay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Refine your skills and test your luck by playing multiple runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After receiving your daily item, the game will auto-save.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["CROWJETS"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613450/626e8f41ac4cdc9ee743a08ba4a6c50